msgstr "Garage, parking space or cellar let together with the flat. The rent share is already included in the base rent of the rent conditions and is only shown separately in the agreement."

msgid "Konditionen (Kaltmiete, Vorauszahlungen) werden unter „Konditionen“ mit Gültigkeitsdatum erfasst – als Gesamtmiete inkl. Garage/Stellplatz. Jede Erhöhung = neuer Eintrag."
msgstr "Rent conditions (base rent, advance payments) are entered under “Rent conditions” with a valid-from date – as the total rent incl. garage/parking. Each increase = new entry."

